     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "This is a Zen desk"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "It’s true that Zendesk was created to bring a sense of calm to the often chaotic world of customer service. It’s also true that Zendesk was born on a literal desk. Well, actually it was a door. And really, it was more of a kitchen table. A lot of beer was spilled on it."
    }
